{"4236910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slay The Berserker", "steam_appid": 4236910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/ce850dc01b8e6796d1e859d7e67f5285.poster.avif?t=1787717942\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/ce850dc01b8e6796d1e859d7e67f5285.webm?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/ce850dc01b8e6796d1e859d7e67f5285.mp4?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay The Berserker is a fast-paced 3D hack and slash dark fantasy created by a Solo Developer that captures the spirit of early 2000s action games. The Berserker has invaded your village, leaving destruction in his wake. As the last warrior standing, you must wield your blade against his forces while navigating diverse environments with treacherous platforming and hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/46b2dc2db4824c4765aabafb806c640b.poster.avif?t=1787717942\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/46b2dc2db4824c4765aabafb806c640b.webm?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/46b2dc2db4824c4765aabafb806c640b.mp4?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut enemies cleanly in half with fluid swordplay as you traverse from the Silent Forests to the Peak of Prison Mountain. Each biome presents unique challenges that test both your combat skills and platforming ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted entirely by one developer, Slay The Berserker delivers a distinctive visual style that pays homage to the era of 2000's action classics while maintaining modern controls. The game's dark fantasy aesthetic creates an immersive atmosphere where every slash, jump, and enemy encounter feels deliberate and impactful. For fans of classic 3D hack and slash games, this is a concentrated dose of everything that made those titles great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/9fb6666a4c1aad59cdb4a7da2616f2e2.poster.avif?t=1787717942\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/9fb6666a4c1aad59cdb4a7da2616f2e2.webm?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/9fb6666a4c1aad59cdb4a7da2616f2e2.mp4?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/ce850dc01b8e6796d1e859d7e67f5285.poster.avif?t=1787717942\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/ce850dc01b8e6796d1e859d7e67f5285.webm?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/ce850dc01b8e6796d1e859d7e67f5285.mp4?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay The Berserker is a fast-paced 3D hack and slash dark fantasy created by a Solo Developer that captures the spirit of early 2000s action games. The Berserker has invaded your village, leaving destruction in his wake. As the last warrior standing, you must wield your blade against his forces while navigating diverse environments with treacherous platforming and hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/46b2dc2db4824c4765aabafb806c640b.poster.avif?t=1787717942\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/46b2dc2db4824c4765aabafb806c640b.webm?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4236910/extras/46b2dc2db4824c4765aabafb806c640b.mp4?t=1787717942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut enemies cleanly in half with fluid swordplay as you traverse from the Silent Forests to the Peak of Prison Mountain. Each biome presents unique challenges that test both your combat skills and platforming ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted entirely by one developer, Slay The Berserker delivers a distinctive visual style that pays homage to the era of 2000's action classics while maintaining modern controls. The game's dark fantasy aesthetic creates an immersive atmosphere where every slash, jump, and enemy encounter feels deliberate and impactful. For fans of classic 3D hack and slash games, this is a concentrated dose of everything that made those titles great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_